  "title": "Kaixin Holdings Announces Acquisition of XINGCAN, Launching AI Education Business",
  "summary": "BEIJING, Sept. 10, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Kaixin Holdings (“Kaixin” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: KXIN) today announced the signing of a term sheet with XINGCAN, a leading Chinese AI education innovation company. Kaixin plans to issue new shares to acquire a 55% stake in XINGCAN.",
